A single capital with a dot needs two spaces

```
J. R. R. Tolkien wrote it
.
<p>J. R. R. Tolkien wrote it</p>
```

```
A. Smith said so
.
<p>A. Smith said so</p>
```

```
para

P. S. see below
.
<p>para</p>
<p>P. S. see below</p>
```

```
A.  first
B.  second
.
<ol type="A">
  <li>first</li>
  <li>second</li>
</ol>
```

```
A.  first
B. second
.
<ol type="A">
  <li>first
B. second</li>
</ol>
```

```
I. one
II. two
.
<p>I. one
II. two</p>
```

```
A) one
B) two
.
<ol type="A" data-delim=")">
  <li>one</li>
  <li>two</li>
</ol>
```

```
a. one
b. two
.
<p>a. one
b. two</p>
```

```
A.{.c}  x
.
<ol type="A">
  <li class="c">x</li>
</ol>
```

```
A.{.c} x
.
<p>A.{.c} x</p>
```

```
e. g. foo
.
<p>e. g. foo</p>
```

```
a.  one
b.  two
.
<ol type="a">
  <li>one</li>
  <li>two</li>
</ol>
```

```
1. one
2. two
.
<ol>
  <li>one</li>
  <li>two</li>
</ol>
```
